# Buy-Side Research Workspace — Provider Environment Variables

> This is the English translation of [.env.template](./.env.template). The Chinese version is the source of truth.
>
> Copy to .env and fill in the providers you need.
> Playwright is not configured here. Browser-backed flows use local Node.js + Playwright
> runtime or host MCP setup, not provider credentials in .env.

# SEC EDGAR (US stocks)
# Format: "Name email@domain.com"
# Register: https://efts.sec.gov/ (fill in Name + Email, effective immediately)
EDGAR_IDENTITY=

# DART (Korean stocks)
# Register: https://opendart.fss.or.kr/ (free registration, obtain API Key)
# DART_API_KEY=

# EDINET (Japanese stocks)
# Register: https://disclosure2.edinet-fsa.go.jp/ (free registration)
# EDINET_API_KEY=

# FinMind (Taiwan stocks)
# Register: https://finmindtrade.com/ (free registration, obtain Token)
# FINMIND_TOKEN=

# DeepSeek translation (OpenAI-compatible API; daily brief title translation. Recommended)
# Register: https://platform.deepseek.com/ (fill in API Key once obtained)
# DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=
# DEEPSEEK_API_BASE=https://api.deepseek.com/v1
# DEEPSEEK_MODEL=deepseek-v4-flash

# Coverage Monitor delivery (optional)
# SMTP_HOST=
# SMTP_PORT=587
# SMTP_USER=
# SMTP_PASSWORD=
# COVERAGE_EMAIL_TO=
# WECOM_WEBHOOK_URL=
